/-!
# Partial formalization of the fixed-coupling Poisson manuscript

This root imports only declarations checked from their proofs. It does not
declare or prove the manuscript's main Poisson theorem. General conditional
lemmas are distinguished in their module documentation from actual model
theorems; their hypotheses have not all been established for the model. The
qualitative Furstenberg input is an explicit external interface, with no
inhabitant supplied. No other core conclusion is placed in such an interface.
-/
